    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1083">

                <pb facs="0916" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg800"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/3700.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-23T20:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 23, 1912—8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Mexico City press is malignantly denunciatory of the supposed attitude of the
                    Government of the United States. Some papers contain sensational articles
                    practically provocative of attacks on Americans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
